.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-index 1  "index " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-index \- Build (or rebuild) the lookup index from notmuch
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc index\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build (or rebuild) the lookup index from notmuch
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
